,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_09_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"osward_casual","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_09_14","text":"You're in a league of your own.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_09_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"osward_casual","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_09_15","text":"I probably shouldn't say this, but right now, no one in the Ark can even think of touching you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_09_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"osward_casual","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_09_16","text":"You're a symbol everyone looks up to.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_09_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"osward_casual","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_09_17","text":"So go ahead and forge your own path without worry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_09_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty_casual","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_09_18","text":"Wow... hearing you say that really makes me feel so confident.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_09_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty_casual","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_09_19","text":"Okay then, I'll trust you and go my own way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"s005_09_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"pretty_casual","key":"Locale_SideStory:s005_09_20","text":"Yeah, I don't need anything else. With you by my side, I can push through anything!","jump":null,"exit":false,"